&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary $110,000 to $175,000 base salary plus OTE/Commission (50/50)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elwood Technologies provides institutional-grade digital asset trading infrastructure for the world&#39;s leading financial institutions. Our platform combines Execution Management, Portfolio Management, Risk Management and Connectivity into a single institutional workflow, allowing banks, asset managers, hedge funds, brokers and corporates to access digital asset markets through one secure platform. As regulated markets mature, institutions increasingly require enterprise-grade technology rather than fragmented point solutions. Elwood sits at the centre of that ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for an experienced enterprise sales professional who thrives on building pipeline, qualifying complex opportunities and closing strategic software deals. This is a true end-to-end commercial role. You&#39;ll identify and engage institutional prospects, understand their workflows and challenges, coordinate technical discovery with our Product team, manage commercial negotiations and close new business. Once contracts are signed, you&#39;ll work closely with Client Delivery and Onboarding to ensure a smooth transition before handing over the ongoing relationship.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The successful candidate will be responsible for achieving annual revenue targets with a new customer acquisition focus.&amp;nbsp; The successful candidate will have a client centric approach; delivering services, solutions and strategies that represent value for our clients.&amp;nbsp; This role requires a self directed professional who thrives in an independent environment and who has a proven track record of building and closing their own pipeline (0 to 1 sales).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How We Sell:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Generate Pipeline&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build relationships with institutional market participants through outbound prospecting, inbound enquiries, referrals, partnerships and industry events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a consistent pipeline of qualified opportunities within Elwood&#39;s target client segments.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualify Deals&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Understand client workflows, technology, buying processes and commercial objectives.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Focus on opportunities where Elwood can create meaningful value. Solution • Lead the commercial sales process while partnering with the Product team for demonstrations and workflow discussions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;As your product knowledge develops, you&#39;ll progressively take greater ownership of demonstrations while continuing to leverage specialist expertise for complex technical discussions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial Delivery&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own proposals, commercial discussions and negotiations through to signed agreement.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work alongside experienced commercial leadership on pricing strategy and technical validation. Transition • Deliver a structured handover to Client Delivery and Onboarding to ensure a seamless client experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate qualified enterprise pipeline.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run structured discovery meetings with institutional prospects.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate product demonstrations and technical validation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage proposals, pricing discussions and negotiations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate CRM hygiene and forecasting.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Product, Engineering and Client Delivery.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Elwood at industry events.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Achieve quarterly and annual revenue targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications / Knowledge&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 2-3 years of relevant industry experience in a sales or business development role; experience in front end trading systems/tradfi or crypto industry essential&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of driving revenue growth and lead generation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of financial services and the crypto market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong entrepreneurial skills and a natural ability to spot opportunities for revenue generation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong industry/network and connections which could serve as a potential client base&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accountable individual that is willing to take a wide range of responsibility across several different areas within the business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Personable and has the skills to build rapport and establish personal relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to attend regular external events and travel domestically and internationally as required&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💵&amp;nbsp; Competitive salary and compensation packages&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🍎 Fully paid medical and discounted dental schemes for employees and their family&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✈️ Generous time off + bank holidays&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🍼 Enhanced parental leave for all employees who have been with the company for one (1) year&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🍔 Fully stocked kitchen and access to Ubereats&lt;/p&gt;

