&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Title: Fractional IT Support Technician&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Salary £20,000 - £24,000 based on 2 days per week (FTE £50,000-£60,000)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Location: Kings Cross, London&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Elwood&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an FCA-regulated firm, Elwood Technologies provides institutional investors with a seamless, end-to-end digital asset trading, execution, and risk management infrastructure connected to global markets via a single API.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a proactive, detail-oriented Fractional IT Support Technician to manage our day-to-day IT operations, device lifecycle, and SaaS user administration. In this role, you will be the go-to technical resource for our team, ensuring our digital workspace is secure, compliant, and friction-free.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a fractional, part-time position requiring a commitment of 2 days per week at our Kings Cross office (possibility to extend to 3 days as required).&amp;nbsp; Perfect for an experienced IT professional who thrives on building efficient processes, troubleshooting access issues, and maintaining high security standards across a modern, cloud-first infrastructure&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;User Lifecycle &amp;amp; Onboarding&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;New Joiners: Coordinate the end-to-end IT setup for new employees, including configuring hardware, provisioning core system accounts, and delivering a clear, welcoming IT induction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leavers: Oversee the secure offboarding process by coordinating the collection of company-owned physical devices, executing secure remote device wipes, and ensuring local asset return.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Device &amp;amp; Endpoint Management (MDM)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Software &amp;amp; Policy Deployments: Leverage Mobile Device Management (MDM) tools to push critical software updates, system certificates, and global security policies to all endpoints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Security Compliance: Ensure all active devices are securely configured with mandatory software installed (including endpoint security tools like Netskope).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inventory Control: Maintain an up-to-date hardware asset register, tracking the status, location, and assignment of all company laptops and peripherals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Google Workspace Administration&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage user permissions, Google Shared Drives, and Google Groups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement and audit data retention policies in line with corporate compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set up secure email forwarding, aliases, and shared inbox structures upon request.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Access Control &amp;amp; Licensing Troubleshooting&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the assignment of software licenses and system access.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications / Knowledge&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2-3 years of proven IT Support Experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong background in providing technical support both remotely and managing physical hardware assets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced hands-on experience administering Google Workspace (G Suite), Okta, Jira, slack and managing other business application licenses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic scripting experience in Shell or Python to automate repetitive tasks such as user onboarding/offboarding, device configuration, bulk admin changes and similar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience using Mobile Device Management tools to manage, secure, and update fleet laptops (macOS and Windows).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing office devices and peripherals, including printers, meeting room AV/conferencing equipment, monitors, docking stations and other shared hardware.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with office network fundamentals: cable patching, basic switch and Wi-Fi access point troubleshooting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good knowledge of internet security, data privacy principles, and access control frameworks (knowledge of tools like Netskope is highly advantageous).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent troubleshooting capability; able to analyze technical workflows, diagnose API/automation integration failures, and implement quick, reliable fixes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable coordinating hardware logistics, shipping/couriers, and maintaining immaculate records.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills and interpersonal skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organised, self-motivated and ability to work with a structured approval process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Certifications (Desirable): CompTIA A+, Google Workspace Administrator certifications, Microsoft&amp;nbsp; are a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;💵&amp;nbsp; Competitive salary and compensation packages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🍎 Fully paid medical and discounted dental schemes for employees and their family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;✈️ Generous time off + bank holidays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;💪 Onsite gym and wellness centre&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🍔 Weekly Uber eats allowance and snacks provided in the office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🚲 Cycle to Work and Cycle Saver schemes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🍼 Enhanced parental leave for all employees who have been with the company for one (1) year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🐕‍ Employee Assistance Programme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📚 Paid study leave and personal leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Elwood?&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Join a series A FinTech company&amp;nbsp; and help shape the future of finance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A startup with deep financial backing and a strong market presence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our platform is enabling institutional access to the most exciting growth opportunity in Finance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with a modern technology stack and help solve high impact problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong client focused team with a diverse background&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We’re a Global company and have modern, centrally based offices in London, New York and Singapore.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

